@@ -51,10 +52,35 @@ SOFT_RB_SPARE 0x88f, APSS WDT 0x17c10000, UFSHCI 3.0 at 0x1d84000, IMEM restart
 boots Android and pulls the end of rawdump with root (Magisk): the shim log is the 64
